   2 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-14 probe E (PLAN P3-14 H-5): BOUNDARY,
   3 a 0006       bare STATEMENT form of the shadowed name with
   4 a 0006       EMPTY PARENS and NO CALL keyword. DR acceptance
